# Graphify generated artifacts (knowledge graph + AST cache).
# These are derived data: rebuilt by ``graphify update .`` and should
# never be committed. The ``cache/ast/`` tree alone is ~5K JSON files
# and ``graph.json`` is ~500K lines.
graphify-out/

# Root directory markdown files (exclude all except essential docs)
/*.md
!README.md
!SETUP.md
!SETUP_MAC_LINUX.md
!SETUP_WINDOWS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
# Top-tier OSS-project metadata that Sprint A intended to ship but the
# ``/*.md`` rule above silently excluded. Whitelisting them explicitly so
# the next commit (Sprint B) actually tracks them.
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md

